    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blitz is a challenging, fast-paced platformer with infinite procedurally generated levels. Build a new unique character each run and fight one action-packed room after another! With multiple game modes you will be able to master movement, combat, and strategy in this fast paced experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3316400/extras/af8bf2085763be1fe2969023afb857f6.avif?t=1738374303\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Infinite Procedural Dungeons:</u></strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No 2 dungeons are the same </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Maps get bigger and more difficult as you progress</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Replay Value (30+ hours of gameplay)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many gameplay soundtracks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A wide range of level mutators and difficulty settings</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3316400/extras/30a3122f6d88050de6dff1ba66a14302.avif?t=1738374303\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Craft your Character:</strong></u></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build the ultimate character by leveling up to fit your playstyle</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fluid Parkour System</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over a dozen characters to play as</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Traits:</strong> Pick through dozens of unique traits to become more powerful</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Attributes:</strong>\u00a0Select one of the 5 main attributes upon level up (See Below)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strength -</strong> Melee Damage, Kick Power, and Knockback</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dexterity -</strong> Ranged Damage, Reload Speed, Recoil Control, and Arrow Power</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Agility -</strong> Jump Height</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Speed -</strong> Movement Speed on ground and midair.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sight -</strong> Overall Camera FOV</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3316400/extras/0e4ebaaf9b817e38d987845dec0028ff.avif?t=1738374303\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>All the loot:</u></strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many many weapons <strong>(Guns, Bows, Swords, Rocket Launchers)</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find anvils and cauldrons around the map to craft</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Armor -</strong> Many Armor Types with increasing damage resistance</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cover -</strong> Deploy cover to aid you in battle (A team to fight alongside you, a crate to shoot behind</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Throwables -</strong>\u00a0A boatload of Grenades, Spears, Blades, etc.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gold -</strong> Use this to buy from traders</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3316400/extras/ca2f26e33661bcdda74999d71cb757d1.avif?t=1738374303\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Advanced Ai with voicelines:</strong></u></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dozens of base enemies that evolve in further stages</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemies level up and evolve like the character</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A wide range of difficulty settings for any skill level</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Npcs that you can hire</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beasts that can be tamed</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Game Modes:</u></strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dungeon:</strong> Fight your way through ominous procedurally generated dungeons, defeating one boss after the other. Find loot, trade with NPCs and craft your character into something unstoppable.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survival:</strong> Survive wave after wave of enemies putting your movement and combat skill to the test.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Climb:</strong> Similar to Jump Knight or Getting over it. Scale a huge vertical map in an attempt to obtain legendary status.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gladiator:</strong>\u00a0Fight through increasingly difficult arenas, stacking gold and buying equipment to become stronger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul>",
